<title>USA: Chartwell Re Corp unit names Wenman CEO.</title>
<headline>Chartwell Re Corp unit names Wenman CEO.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chartwell Re Corp said on Tuesday that it named Stephen Wenman chief executive of its Archer Group subsidiary, a managing agency of Lloyds of London.</p>
<p>Bryan Kellett, the previous chief executive, continues as chairman of the London-based unit.</p>
<p>Wenman previously was chairman of the Special Risk Services Group.</p>
<p>Chartwell acquired Archer in December.</p>
</text>
